SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Friday April 24th)
  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nSongs that I have written for well 
 over 36 years.\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWonderful and Beautufi ne
 w songs every week\, including some of our favorites!\n\n\\*You are welcom
 e to join us any time after 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcom
 e to come on later in the evening as well\n**\\*\\*Attend for free if you 
 like - if it's your first time attending :)**\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nS
 incerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwriter/Producer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:
 \n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Friday April 24th)**\n
 **(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs by Songwriter and Producer S
 teve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, spiritual songs\, songs abo
 ut nature\, our culture\, our past\, our future\, relationships and our li
 ves\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a fusion of mixed genres like\
 , **Folk\, Traditional Folk\, Country\, Blue Grass\, Singer Song Writer\, 
 Soft Rock\, Easy Listening\, Classic Rock\, R & B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult C
 ontemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**p and many others genres too. So please sit b
 ack and get ready to have an amazing auditory experience in the comforts o
 f your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and off at any time during the ni
 ght- starting at 8:30 pm\n\n**About Steve Flemming:**\nHighly influenced b
 y the great singer songwriters of the 50s\, 60s\, 70s\, 80s and 90s. I hav
 e been writing my own songs since 1990. Songs about life\, love\, loss\, h
 ope\, faith\, joy\, romance\, memories\, spirituality and heartbreak. Song
 s that are universal\, heartfelt and often relevant to the lives of many o
 thers.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You Can: 
 (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n**stev
 eflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly appreci
 ated to help support this meaningful musical endeavor and song loving comm
 unity\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimoni
 als from Past Events:**\nYour songs are wonder-full\, speak to emotions\, 
 experiences and moments we've all felt and lived. S. B.\nSteve Flemming is
  an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the soul. He transforms everyday 
 thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and magical tunes. Amazing stuff y
 et again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a night of heartfelt\, exhil
 arating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for having me my friend. I lo
 ve your words\, they calm me and energize me at the same time I'll look fo
 rward to your next invite\nM.Z.\nThese great songs definitely helped me to
  decompress after a long day. Keep up the song writing Steve\, these are g
 reat! - S.S.\nThank you so much for a relaxing evening and sharing your in
 spiring music Steve! I am excited to hear more and I hope you do this agai
 n!! - C.B\nLovely songs and a great vibe with wonderful people. I couldn
 ’t have asked for a better way to close my day. Huge thanks Steve\, for 
 inviting me! I truly enjoyed every moment! - N.A.\nThe lyrics are amazing.
  From the heart...\nThanks Steve for the amazing tunes. I'm truly blown aw
 ay. Very glad I joined.\n\\- E\\.E\\.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
